OL,3,GNEWSASecond data centre planned for
OL,4,ALanarkshire as regulations tightened
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second data centre is set to be built
OL,7,Fin North Lanarkshire as part of an
OL,8,Fongoing drive to turn the region into a
OL,9,Ftechnology hub.
OL,11,FNews that tech company DataVita intend
OL,12,Fto expand their current site in Airdrie
OL,13,Fand construct a second centre in the
OL,14,Farea came as the Scottish government
OL,15,Ftightened regulations on planning
OL,16,Fpermission for the facilities.
OL,18,FPlanning authorities will be required
OL,19,Fto notify Scottish ministers of new
OL,20,Fdata centre applications within seven
OL,21,Fdays of validation if they exceed 50
OL,22,Fmegawatts (MW) in power capacity.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
