OL,3,GNEWSASecond data centre planned for
OL,4,ALanarkshire as regulations tightened
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland is considered an ideal
OL,7,Flocation for data centres due to
OL,8,Fplentiful renewable energy to power
OL,9,Fthem, but they are controversial in
OL,10,Flocal communities.
